cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, cite the software using the Zenodo concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22067277 or the exact version DOI for the release you used. The frozen v0.8.2 scientific infrastructure is archived at 10.5281/zenodo.22067278. Version 0.8.3 adds SoftwareX submission packaging and publication-support utilities without changing the immutable v0.8.2 scientific source or generating confirmatory efficacy results. The OSF DOI 10.17605/OSF.IO/64DTX identifies the preregistered protocol, not a software release."
title: "SeismicShield-RL: Preregistered Reproducible Infrastructure for Seismic Damper Co-Design Benchmarking"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kowsari
    given-names: Faramarz
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1692-0453"
version: 0.8.3
date-released: 2026-08-28
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22067277"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FaramarzKowsari/seismicshield-rl"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22067277"
license: MIT
abstract: "SoftwareX submission packaging for a preregistered reproducible benchmark platform. The immutable v0.8.2 scientific infrastructure remains the scientific source; full Stage-A and confirmatory Tier-2 campaigns remain deferred, and no algorithm-efficacy result is claimed."
keywords:
  - seismic engineering
  - reinforcement learning
  - multi-agent reinforcement learning
